    21  /*
    22   * This is a very simple HTTP Client interface which aims to provide an
    23   * easy way to issue HTTP requests and handle reponses from the input/output
    24   * plugins.
    25   *
    26   * It scope is:
    27   *
    28   * - Use upstream connections.
    29   * - Support 'retry' in case the HTTP server timeouts a connection.
    30   * - Get return Status, Headers and Body content if found.
    31   * - If Upstream supports keepalive, adjust headers
    32   */
